{"id": "EUVD-2026-103034", "enisaUuid": "109515bf-7798-3dc2-97c0-56026b0cc9d9", "description": "netdisk-fast-download through 0.4.8 contains an information disclosure vulnerability that allows unauthenticated attackers to retrieve donated netdisk credentials via the /v2/randomAuth endpoint in ParserApi. Attackers can repeatedly call the endpoint and decrypt the encryptedAuth blob using the hard-coded AES key nfd_auth_key2026 to recover other users' cloud-drive cookies, tokens, or passwords.", "datePublished": "2026-10-16T17:38:51", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T19:27:08", "baseScore": 8.7, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:H/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/netdisk-fast-download-randomauth-donated-credential-disclosure", "https://github.com/qaiu/netdisk-fast-download/blob/v0.4.8/web-service/src/main/java/cn/qaiu/lz/web/controller/ParserApi.java#L738-L752", "https://github.com/qaiu/netdisk-fast-download/blob/v0.4.8/web-service/src/main/java/cn/qaiu/lz/common/util/AuthParamCodec.java#L31", "https://github.com/qaiu/netdisk-fast-download", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/netdisk-fast-download-through-0.4.8-credential-disclosure-via-v2-randomauth"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-111612", "GHSA-9363-c6w4-4xc7"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.49, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1db07c1c-b2c2-30dd-acde-2e15f219dc6b", "product": {"name": "netdisk-fast-download", "vendor": {"name": "qaiu"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.4.8"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "598dd513-565a-3994-9d5a-41780071937c", "vendor": {"name": "qaiu"}}], "isExploited": false}